From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:52:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1146/3799] soh: rename D_80B9A818 -> sSpawnCounts

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the number of child actors each params variant manages; every loop over actorSpawnPtrList is bounded by it.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure2/z_obj_mure2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure2/z_obj_mure2.c   | 15 ++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure2/z_obj_mure2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Mure2/z_obj_mure2.c
